# S279b: from state 4 (rolling at 15 ft/s toward the first lip), gas, full left for 25 ticks, then
# straight on: the bike runs into a nat05 mesh near (2421, 402, 3348) and wrecks on row ~189, the
# rider's spheres and sweeps pairing with it (and hitting it) from that row.
down cross
